&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a multi-team engineering organization responsible for alerting, event management, monitor creation experiences, and autonomous detection capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the technical and organizational strategy for the Detection Platform while aligning stakeholders across Engineering, Product, Design, and Applied Science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation in AI-powered detection, anomaly identification, and signal generation that helps customers proactively identify and resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale highly available platform systems that process hundreds of millions of evaluations while maintaining reliability, performance, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and mentor engineering managers and technical leaders, fostering a culture of execution, collaboration, and technical rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion customer-centric product thinking by balancing platform investments with intuitive user experiences and measurable customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience leading engineering organizations that build large-scale platforms, infrastructure, observability, monitoring, or developer-facing products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine deep technical expertise with strong product instincts and can make architectural decisions while understanding customer needs and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading leaders and managing engineering managers across multiple teams and domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of defining long-term technical vision, building organizational alignment, and delivering complex initiatives through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working with machine learning, AI-enabled products, intelligent automation, or large-scale detection systems, either directly or through close partnership with specialized teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an effective communicator who can inspire teams, influence senior stakeholders, and navigate ambiguity while driving measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
