&lt;p&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Technical Solutions to proactively drive adoption from onboarding through to maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and project manage the on-boarding process for new customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover, own and manage the customer’s success plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent alignment with decision makers on the impact of their investment in Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
