&lt;p&gt;As a Finance Systems Analyst, you will play a key role in modernizing Datadog&#39;s finance organization through process automation, data analytics, and financial systems optimization. Working within the Finance Systems team, you will partner closely with Accounting, FP&amp;amp;A, Tax, and other finance stakeholders to improve the efficiency, accuracy, and scalability of financial processes and reporting. You will leverage technologies such as AI tools, SQL, Python, Tableau, and financial systems to analyze data, automate workflows, and deliver actionable insights. This role offers an opportunity to help shape how emerging technologies, including AI, transform finance operations while contributing to strategic decision-making across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Accounting, FP&amp;amp;A, Tax, and other Finance stakeholders to gather requirements and translate business needs into scalable reporting and analytics solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including IT, Business Systems, Sales Systems, and Analytics to drive data and automation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reporting tools that monitor financial and operational performance and support evolving business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate recurring finance processes and enhance data workflows using AI tools, data visualization platforms, and custom solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support financial system implementations and upgrades through data migration, mapping, reporting integration, testing, and validation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
