&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1720&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb362122c959&quot;&gt;You are familiar with or very interested in MCP servers and differences between human and agentic UX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1720&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb362122c959&quot;&gt;You have a sharp eye for design and strong opinions on the micro-interactions — keyboard navigation, autocomplete behavior, loading states — that separate a good search experience from a great one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1720&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb362122c959&quot;&gt;You have a strong technical background, and sense of the day in the life of an engineer operating large-scale data systems&lt;/li&gt;
