&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3509&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d4e142f7d368&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b5ee0244adee&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3e3fbaa9f2f0&quot;&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3729&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a384739af5d1&quot;&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds&lt;/p&gt;
