&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3295&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0070264f288&quot;&gt;Versatile in a wide range of cloud technologies relevant to the full suite of Datadog products - including infrastructure, &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;APM&lt;/span&gt;, security, analytics and AI/ML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3456&quot; data-local-id=&quot;43830d084ec6&quot;&gt;Able to focus on high priority testing goals based on value and risk assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3540&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b2e61c5f1108&quot;&gt;Able to prioritize multiple stakeholders and projects with limited resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot; data-local-id=&quot;add46e40d0ef&quot;&gt;A self-starter who excels in technically demanding, fast-paced, and fluid environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3710&quot; data-local-id=&quot;83aea0c17e42&quot;&gt;Able to demonstrate creative and analytical thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3766&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbe580e8e730&quot;&gt;Able to collect feedback from multiple parties, summarize this feedback and merge it with facts and comparisons across similar applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3910&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7c4e969161f8&quot;&gt;Able to build and maintain a network of relationships to facilitate deal flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3991&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46a7d3b87265&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why You Should Apply:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4017&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e861953b3470&quot;&gt;Continuous career development with plenty of exposure to our founders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4090&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cfe6eb69e22e&quot;&gt;Opportunity to learn and access the latest tech and influence how we plan to use it&lt;/li&gt;
