&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Managers to define ambiguous product requirements and determine the most impactful solutions for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical strategy and execution and design systems surrounding log query performance and ingestion at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
