&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep experience architecting and scaling backend systems, with a strong focus on data-intensive or distributed infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel in ambiguous environments, demonstrating a mix of drive, curiosity and pragmatic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve partnered effectively with Product Managers and customers to define product direction and ship impactful features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have expertise in debugging complex systems and optimizing performance across real-time data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in using AI agents tools in your day-to-day engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead by example and enjoy helping others grow through mentorship and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: you’re motivated to push the boundaries of how AI can improve software engineering best practices and contribute to building AI-enabled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
