&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2137&quot;&gt;You have 10+ years of experience in visual and/or product design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;You have led a meaningful visual evolution or rebrand within a mature product ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2297&quot;&gt;You have strong taste and are comfortable defending a point of view.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2369&quot;&gt;You know how to translate brand into scalable product systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;You think in systems, but you’re motivated by craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;You’re comfortable operating in ambiguity and defining direction where none exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2578&quot;&gt;You can influence across design, engineering, and executive partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2651&quot;&gt;Your portfolio demonstrates exceptional visual craft and product thinking — not just applied systems work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2784&quot;&gt;DRUIDS powers every Datadog experience. The decisions made in this role will shape how millions of interactions feel across web, mobile, and emerging AI-driven surfaces. This is an opportunity to define visual direction inside a complex, engineering-forward platform and raise the craft bar across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
