&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of experience in a technical customer-facing role (TAM, Solutions Architect, SRE, DevOps Engineer, or similar) within the cloud or observability space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re confident with at least two public cloud platforms (e.g. AWS, Azure, GCP) and have hands-on experience with infrastructure or application monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re familiar with scripting or automation tools (e.g. Python, Bash, Terraform, Chef/Puppet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have working knowledge of CI/CD pipelines and containerization tools (e.g. Jenkins, GitLab, Docker, Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
